{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676780/extras/LOGO-WITH-EXPLOSION-GIF-LAYERS.gif?t=1742533659\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through the first wasteland in it's entirety, packed with random surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock the full initial roster of mutations to craft your ultimate mutant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Power up Rad Boy with multiple permanent upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lay explosive eggs and hatch a man in a chicken suit....</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2676780?t=1742533659","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2676780?t=1742533659","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676780/d897d96cea7ecde9d1c73b0a89f0079ac7192290/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742533659","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676780/d897d96cea7ecde9d1c73b0a89f0079ac7192290/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742533659","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>21ST OF MARCH, 2025 - DEMO UPDATES</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fixed attack speed stacking with Spines. No more machinegun porcupine. I'm sorry.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fixed full screen/windowed toggle in options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Added some new wasteland props and decals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Probably some other new nonsense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676780/extras/LOGO-WITH-EXPLOSION-GIF-LAYERS.gif?t=1742533659\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></p><br><h1>JANUARY 2025 - SUPER DEMO UPDATE SPECTACULAR</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(MAJORLY) UPDATED DEMO\u00a0 - JANUARY 2025 <br>The latest Ground Zero Hero demo is live with a bunch of changes, new surprises and A LOT of extra polish from the GZH: Prologue version. Come and check it out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676780/extras/trailerThumb.png?t=1742533659\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676780/extras/LOGO-WITH-EXPLOSION-GIF-LAYERS.gif?t=1742533659\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through the first wasteland in it's entirety, packed with random surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock the full initial roster of mutations to craft your ultimate mutant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Power up Rad Boy with multiple permanent upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lay explosive eggs and hatch a man in a chicken suit....</p></li></ul>","developers":["Rowan Edmondson"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2570580","name":"Ground Zero Hero"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676780/header.jpg?t=1742533659","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Gra